#. type: Plain text
#: debian-unstable opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Resize the window to match the size deduced via B<\\%setupterm>(3NCURSES).  "
"Normally this has no effect, unless B<setupterm> is not able to detect the "
"window size."
